    "x1": 3230,
    "z1": 4930
   },
   "text": "His coffee went over. A photo of a girl with a fish, propped against the glass."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 3230,
    "z0": 4080,
    "x1": 4590,
    "z1": 5100
   },
   "text": "Gauze, soaked through. He dressed something in a hurry.\nA bite, by the look of the first aid box. Everything in it is gone."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 5440,
    "z0": 3349,
    "x1": 7140,
    "z1": 4420
   },
   "text": "The handset is hanging off the hook. The line's dead."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 5950,
    "z0": 5134,
    "x1": 7140,
    "z1": 5865
   },
   "text": "ARKLAY SKYWAY. See the valley the way the eagles do.\nSomeone has scratched out the family's eyes."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 3570,
    "z0": 5100,
    "x1": 4420,
    "z1": 6120
   },
